ndencies**:\n   - Use `pytorch` and other necessary libraries by running:\n     ```sh\n     conda install pytorch torchvision torchaudio cudatoolkit=11.3 -c pytorch -c nvidia\n     conda install -c conda-forge tqdm albumentations imageio einops\n     ```\n\n4. **Clone the Repository**:\n   - Clone the `stylegan2-ada-pytorch` repository:\n     ```sh\n     git clone https://github.com/dvschultz/stylegan2-ada-pytorch.git\n     cd stylegan2-ada-pytorch\n     ```\n\n5. **Install the Repository**:\n   - Install the repository using pip:\n     ```sh\n     pip install -e .\n     ```\n\n6. **Run the Example Code**:\n   - You can now run the example code to test the setup:\n     ```sh\n     python examples/ffhq.py\n     ```\n\n7. **Verify Installation**:\n   - Ensure that the environment is correctly set up and that you can run the example without errors.\n\nIf you face any specific issues, feel free to provide error messages or details, and I can assist you further.\n\nIf you decide to switch to a different interaction at any point, feel free to use the string `_SWITCHCONVERSATION_` to indicate that."}, {"key": [186, 3, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -4.515192021410794e-06, "log_surv_s": -2.626826605194816e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [186, 3, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -5.60120159663842e-06, "log_surv_s": -2.7241595124506162e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [186, 3, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -4.033690384008759e-06, "log_surv_s": -9.612963948083073e-07, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [186, 3, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -3.0993891511468366e-06, "log_surv_s": -1.4963176424481368e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [223, 1, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -1.6463490256670873e-05, "log_surv_s": -8.657902453314365e-05, "gen_len": 270, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [223, 1, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -7.045712228994601e-05, "log_surv_s": -0.00043320766796069307, "gen_len": 206, "bail_lea